Modifications and new implementation, 2026: Julia array/view semantics,
task-owned aligned packing buffers, VecElement/LLVM vector microkernels,
Julia threading, complex interleaved 4M kernels, public Julia API, tests,
benchmarks and documentation. No upstream Rust numerical binaries are used by
the Julia package. Rust is compiled separately only for reference verification.

This is an incomplete port; it is not an upstream release or a claim of
feature parity. See docs/STATUS.md and docs/upstream_inventory.csv.
